      "text": "i started bidding and buying here.\n\nnot because things have changed. actually, not much has. but something important did.\n\nwe're still following equities. the Fed is still ahead of us, macro is a mess, and there's enough geopolitical risk out there to send bitcoin down $5k in a single candle.\n\ni still think we could see $75k, maybe even lower if someone big capitulates and takes everyone down with them.\n\nbut here's what's interesting.\n\nthe same people who were calling for $100k are now shorting $80k. every influencer suddenly has a very convincing explanation for why we need to go lower.\nand after all the shit we've been through, bitcoin is still around $80k.\n\nthat's worth paying attention to.\n\none positive headline or stocks ticking up and we're back at $83k, $85k. maybe even $90k before the next bad headline hits.\n\nimagine everyone waiting for the big capitulation candle, and when it finally comes, bitcoin dumps from $90k to $85k instead of $80k to $75k.\n\nthe level everyone was terrified of becomes support.\n\nand the same people shorting $80k will be explaining why $100k was inevitable.\n\ni'm not calling the bottom. but I started buying again.",
